      <title>One in four women globally unable to refuse sex within marriage, says UN</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2026/nov/19/women-girls-rights-rape-sexual-violence-africa-marriage-unfpa</link>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Almost half of women in west and central Africa cannot withhold consent, with girls worst affected, UNFPA finds&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One in four women around the world have no power of consent if their husband or partner demands sex, according to a UN report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In west and central Africa, almost half of women (45%) are not able to say no in their own marriage, while a third of women (33%) in east and southern Africa and in Arab states face the same predicament. In Latin America and the Caribbean, one in 10 women are not able to refuse sex, said &lt;a href="https://www.unfpa.org/swp2026"&gt;the report&lt;/a&gt; by the UN Population Fund (&lt;a href="https://www.unfpa.org/latest?_gl=1*qgl8yd*_up*MQ..*_gs*MQ..&amp;amp;gclid=Cj0KCQiAtvXXBhC2ARIsAJc8SUT_aKqck2yVoC8vNqJ6FDghCWHDwCXcKD3yGJ9fmgqTGSh0z0LaYAcaAvlMEALw_wcB&amp;amp;gbraid=0AAAAAoaU5jLrFra9lcVEXtmHPvgYu0nsj"&gt;UNFPA&lt;/a&gt;) published on Thursday.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2026/nov/19/women-girls-rights-rape-sexual-violence-africa-marriage-unfpa"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;</description>
